  concept_lookup_resolved
    defined-by output
    role output_display_request
    precondition "A concept lookup produced a licensed sense from captured source bytes."
    effect "Quote the gloss and attribute its URL, digest and license."
    unit "count"
    example "The surface is defined with an attributed source digest."
    grounding "src/solver_unknown_reasoning.rs::answer_from_retrieved_senses"
