  concept_lookup_offline_miss
    defined-by output
    role output_display_request
    precondition "Live retrieval is disabled and no capture exists for the concept surface."
    effect "State the offline boundary and name the sources that lacked captures."
    unit "count"
    example "The lookup was not attempted because no cached capture exists."
    grounding "src/source_walk.rs::observe_failure"
